-- items that carry an item level; everything else (consumables, quest items,
-- reagents, recipes, containers, ...) is useless for a gear comparison table
-- and would only add dead weight to every user's download. Item quality and
-- equip location are not in the source data and are not invented here; the
-- addon reads those live from the client for anything it evaluates.
--
-- Field names are single letters to keep the file small, matching DungeonLoot.lua.

